      "description": "• Migrated the team's package tool from ASP.NET and jQuery to Vue 3 and .NET 8 with full feature parity. The tool packages builds, runs smoke tests against real hardware, and publishes artifacts to a network share a downstream automation team works from. \n• Built the team's universal Jenkins pipeline. Applications now have one build-and-test path, and the pipeline blocks merges to master in Bitbucket when tests fail. \n• Added Playwright end-to-end suites to the pipeline, which extended merge gating from unit tests to full user flows. \n• Moved artifact deployment from Octopus Deploy to BuildMaster and cut subscription costs by thousands a year. Jenkins still builds and archives; BuildMaster handles the deploy. \n• Maintained production apps across ASP.NET, Visual Basic, JavaScript and jQuery, which meant working in four separate stacks.",
