      "description": "• Led the consolidation of five separate test suites into one Python platform. They had drifted apart over the years, each written in a proprietary or legacy language, and all covered the same ground. \n• The platform became the automation department's shared tooling, used by 50+ engineers worldwide. \n• Led a 14-person team across US and overseas sites as lead architect, program owner and scrum master. \n• Kept the team's DevOps platform running: Jenkins, Docker, Artifactory, Bitbucket. \n• Presented roadmaps and delivery forecasts to directors.",
      "insights": "Scaled Agile Framework, Jenkins and +32 skills"
